blocks.en:
Table 8 : Robustness across every configuration axis raised in review. Each row is an independent family of paired image-level comparisons with its own BH
correction; “TTA” counts positive point estimates and “BH” counts q < 0.05 q<0.05 . The matched-budget, replication, architecture, and placement families are uniformly positive;
the two DRIVE-only sweeps show smaller effects, non-significant cells, and three tiny seed reversals.

blocks.zh:
表8:审查中提出的每个配置轴的强度。 每行是一个独立家族,由组合的图像级别与自己的BH比较
“TTA”计为正点估计数,“BH”计为q < 0.05 q < 0.05”。 相应的预算、复制、建筑和安置家庭是一致积极的;
两次只有DRIVE的扫射 显示了较小的效果, 非显著的细胞, 和三个微小的种子逆转。
